<section class="ms-hero"><div class="ms-w ms-bento"><div class="ms-b ms-b-t"><p class="ms-ey">Small food, big joy</p><h1>Mor<br>sels</h1><p class="ms-hero-p">An independent guide to bite-sized food: canap&eacute;s, crostini and the little things that disappear first at every party.</p><a class="ms-btn" href="#builder">Build a bite &rarr;</a></div><div class="ms-b ms-b-i1"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1784019841674-8b029cc79d1e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&h=700&q=75" alt="a tray of assorted canapes" width="900" height="700" fetchpriority="high"></div><div class="ms-b ms-b-i2"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1548340748-6d2b7d7da280?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&h=500&q=75" alt="crispy fried bites held up" width="500" height="500" fetchpriority="high"></div><div class="ms-b ms-b-n"><b data-count="3">3</b><span>bites per guest, per hour</span></div><div class="ms-b ms-b-i3"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574862612978-33bdb5f6a334?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&h=500&q=75" alt="small toasts topped with tomatoes" width="500" height="500" fetchpriority="high"></div><div class="ms-b ms-b-s" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120"><defs><path id="st" d="M60 60 m-44 0 a44 44 0 1 1 88 0 a44 44 0 1 1 -88 0"/></defs><text><textPath href="#st">FRESH &#183; BITES &#183; DAILY &#183; MADE &#183; </textPath></text><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="16" fill="#E2483D"/></svg></div></div></section>

